1
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:09,980
(Hwang In Youp)

2
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:14,390
(Lee Hye Ri)

3
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:21,790
(Baek Sung Chul, Lee Yul Eum)

4
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:39,079
(Dream To You)

5
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,080
(All people, events, and backgrounds are fictional.)

6
00:00:40,081 --> 00:00:41,109
(This drama includes footage created using AI.)

7
00:00:41,110 --> 00:00:42,110
(Children and animals were filmed under strict safety guidelines.)

8
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:45,379
I am funding Su Bin's movie,

9
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,920
and I have urgent business to discuss with him.

10
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:49,820
You're one crazy witch, aren't you?

11
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:52,290
I must be a crazy witch to have dated a bastard like you...

12
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,830
- without knowing you were married. - Are you still sore about that?

13
00:00:55,030 --> 00:00:56,289
You were the one who told me to get a divorce...

14
00:00:56,290 --> 00:00:57,660
because you were pregnant.

15
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,430
The audio you just heard is from a recording...

16
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:02,070
that's rapidly spreading online.

17
00:01:02,170 --> 00:01:03,640
It's the controversial file in question.

18
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:05,640
She is a former Miss Korea turned actress,

19
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:07,510
and the current CEO of Top Line Entertainment,

20
00:01:07,570 --> 00:01:08,570
Ahn Soo Hee.

21
00:01:08,810 --> 00:01:10,140
She had an inappropriate relationship...

22
00:01:10,210 --> 00:01:11,680
with a married man, Mr. A, in the past...

23
00:01:11,980 --> 00:01:12,980
Everyone.

24
00:01:15,050 --> 00:01:16,850
I never thought I'd have to say this.

25
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,050
All right, as of this moment, unplug all the phone lines.

26
00:01:21,550 --> 00:01:23,920
Block all the entrances. Don't let a single rat get in.

27
00:01:24,320 --> 00:01:25,460
- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.

28
00:01:29,130 --> 00:01:30,300
You're filming right now, aren't you?

29
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Reporters will probably be arriving on set soon.

30
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:34,399
An audio file of your mother, Ahn Soo Hee, has been released.

31
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:37,070
Did you by any chance know that...

32
00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:39,000
you and Director Ian are half-siblings?

33
00:01:40,610 --> 00:01:42,410
Is it true you and Director Ian Woo are siblings?

34
00:01:43,340 --> 00:01:44,580
Did you still decide to be in the film?

35
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:46,610
- Please give us a comment. - Please say something.

36
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:49,280
- At least tell us if it's true. - Please look this way.

37
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,480
Oh Ha Na, please look over here.

38
00:01:50,550 --> 00:01:52,580
What are your thoughts on the casting favouritism controversy?

39
00:01:52,650 --> 00:01:53,650
Oh Ha Na.

40
00:01:58,320 --> 00:01:59,320
Block them!

41
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:01,860
- CEO Ahn Soo Hee. - CEO Ahn Soo Hee.

42
00:02:02,460 --> 00:02:03,460
- CEO Ahn Soo Hee. - CEO Ahn Soo Hee.

43
00:02:03,930 --> 00:02:05,229
- Move! - Do you admit...

44
00:02:05,230 --> 00:02:06,530
Director Woo is your biological son?

45
00:02:07,170 --> 00:02:09,030
- Just say something. - Aren't you deceiving the public?

46
00:02:09,070 --> 00:02:11,269
- Why did you invest in this film? - Listen up, reporters.

47
00:02:11,270 --> 00:02:13,200
Don't you know this is all grounds for a lawsuit?

48
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:15,410
How dare you barge onto a film set?

49
00:02:15,610 --> 00:02:18,510
I'll remember every single one of your faces.

50
00:02:19,210 --> 00:02:21,650
Reporter Park, it's been a while.

51
00:02:21,810 --> 00:02:23,179
You must've caught wind of a big story...

52
00:02:23,180 --> 00:02:24,450
and came running like a dog.

53
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:26,380
Your heart must have been pounding on your way here.

54
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:30,360
What are you doing? Everyone, get back to work.

55
00:02:36,430 --> 00:02:38,060
Ahn Soo Hee, please look over here just once.

56
00:02:38,130 --> 00:02:39,230
Please give us a statement.

57
00:02:39,630 --> 00:02:41,530
- Are you officially admitting it? - CEO Ahn!

58
00:02:41,830 --> 00:02:43,270
Please give us a comment.

59
00:02:43,940 --> 00:02:45,740
Was this a choice made to protect someone?

60
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,370
Ahn Soo Hee, why did you have an affair?

61
00:02:48,610 --> 00:02:50,010
She had an inappropriate relationship...

62
00:02:50,070 --> 00:02:51,080
with a married man, Mr. A,

63
00:02:51,140 --> 00:02:53,080
and it's claimed that the child they had together...

64
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:55,850
is Director Ian Woo.

65
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,480
What is this?

66
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:00,690
This isn't true, right?

67
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:02,790
This had better not be true. You hear me?

68
00:03:06,220 --> 00:03:07,360
Mom!

69
00:03:07,730 --> 00:03:10,599
I'm sure it was that jerk, Director Kang.

70
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:11,699
Where did that son of a witch run off to?

71
00:03:11,700 --> 00:03:14,470
Ma'am, one of your people did this,

72
00:03:15,070 --> 00:03:16,270
so please take responsibility and fix it.

73
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:18,770
I'm just going to focus on the movie.

74
00:03:21,010 --> 00:03:23,240
Ha Na. Did you hear the director?

75
00:03:24,210 --> 00:03:25,440
The director wants to keep filming.

76
00:03:25,510 --> 00:03:26,980
The lead actress shouldn't walk off set, right?

77
00:03:27,110 --> 00:03:28,380
Didn't you once say that even time is something...

78
00:03:28,450 --> 00:03:31,450
- wielded by the powerful? - And I'm the one with the power.

79
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:34,220
That means you still have a long way to go.

80
00:03:37,590 --> 00:03:39,720
Why am I the only one who's surprised by this?

81
00:03:42,460 --> 00:03:44,560
I'll send guards to control the set,

82
00:03:45,130 --> 00:03:46,730
so continue filming without any delays.

83
00:03:47,070 --> 00:03:48,870
Aren't either of you going to explain this to me?

84
00:03:49,230 --> 00:03:51,200
- Oh Ha Na. - Director Woo.

85
00:03:51,900 --> 00:03:53,340
Have you forgotten what I said back then?

86
00:03:54,170 --> 00:03:56,210
This whole mess happened because I went to tell you that.

87
00:03:56,470 --> 00:03:58,380
I'm seriously going to lose my mind.

88
00:04:00,350 --> 00:04:02,150
- Ha Na. - Let go...

89
00:04:02,710 --> 00:04:04,080
before I kill myself.

90
00:04:06,380 --> 00:04:07,390
What?

91
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:21,400
Ha Na.

92
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,240
Ha Na...

93
00:04:51,430 --> 00:04:53,000
- Isn't that Oh Ha Na? - Take photos.

94
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:55,300
Isn't that Oh Ha Na?

95
00:04:57,870 --> 00:05:00,070
Ms. Oh Ha Na, how long have you known?

96
00:05:00,270 --> 00:05:01,910
Regarding the allegation that your mother, CEO Ahn Soo Hee,

97
00:05:01,970 --> 00:05:04,040
lobbied for your casting, do you admit to it?

98
00:05:05,110 --> 00:05:06,840
Stop pushing!

99
00:05:33,710 --> 00:05:35,569
- Please give us a statement. - Say something.

100
00:05:35,570 --> 00:05:37,480
Ms. Oh Ha Na!

101
00:05:38,010 --> 00:05:39,240
Go to my place for now.

102
00:05:39,780 --> 00:05:41,180
No one will find you there.

103
00:05:41,550 --> 00:05:44,280
- Please give us more details. - Please give us a statement.

104
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,220
Move. Get out of the way.

105
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:49,120
- Ms. Oh Ha Na! - Please give us a statement.

106
00:05:49,250 --> 00:05:50,420
("Ian Woo's New Film, Gyeongseong Love Song")

107
00:05:50,490 --> 00:05:51,490
("Family Project Controversy Spreads")

108
00:06:03,900 --> 00:06:07,369
Here's the revised schedule. I excluded Nan Yeong's scenes...

109
00:06:07,370 --> 00:06:09,040
and moved up everything else we could.

110
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:18,180
Are you okay?

111
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:21,990
- I'm sorry. - I asked if you were okay.

112
00:06:25,420 --> 00:06:26,420
I'm not okay.

113
00:06:34,700 --> 00:06:37,500
You should take care of yourself first.

114
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,700
Leave the set to me.

115
00:06:43,210 --> 00:06:45,480
Why? Don't you trust me?

116
00:06:46,210 --> 00:06:49,580
Me? The ever-steadfast Director Joo, who remains unshaken even now?

117
00:06:55,820 --> 00:06:57,220
And go check on Ha Na too.

118
00:06:58,190 --> 00:06:59,820
The person Ha Na needs most right now...

119
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,490
is probably you, Su Bin.

120
00:07:08,570 --> 00:07:09,570
Su Bin.

121
00:07:10,500 --> 00:07:12,900
You know what kind of life Ha Na has had.

122
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:14,810
So how could you, of all people,

123
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,610
do something like that?

124
00:07:17,070 --> 00:07:18,810
You cast her, knowing everything.

125
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:22,410
So you think it would've been better not to cast her because of it?

126
00:07:23,210 --> 00:07:25,750
I didn't think it would be fair to her...

127
00:07:25,850 --> 00:07:27,550
not to cast her because of secret past.

128
00:07:28,950 --> 00:07:31,420
I know how much this movie means to Oh Ha Na.

129
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:35,590
All right. I should have told her everything...

130
00:07:37,460 --> 00:07:40,260
and let her make the choice. Maybe that would have been better.

131
00:07:41,700 --> 00:07:42,700
I...

132
00:07:43,430 --> 00:07:44,570
was shortsighted.

133
00:07:56,010 --> 00:07:57,820
What are you going to do if you find out where she is?

134
00:07:59,750 --> 00:08:01,150
Drag her back here to keep filming?

135
00:08:02,650 --> 00:08:04,190
For now, just film all of my scenes.

136
00:08:05,190 --> 00:08:06,760
I'll make sure my emotional continuity is perfect.

137
00:08:06,890 --> 00:08:08,430
That's a given.

138
00:08:13,460 --> 00:08:14,470
Even when I'm not around,

139
00:08:15,230 --> 00:08:16,770
behave yourself and don't give Yi Jae a hard time.

140
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:19,069
- What? - I'm just as worried...

141
00:08:19,070 --> 00:08:20,540
about Ha Na as you are.

142
00:08:21,940 --> 00:08:23,310
I don't think she should be alone.

143
00:08:27,210 --> 00:08:28,250
We can't film this.

144
00:08:29,250 --> 00:08:31,050
We can film this, but Nan Yeong is in this scene.

145
00:08:32,820 --> 00:08:36,620
This is so hard. It's driving me crazy.

146
00:08:45,500 --> 00:08:46,800
(Choi Sa Rang)

147
00:08:49,930 --> 00:08:51,000
Hey, Sa Rang.

148
00:08:51,500 --> 00:08:52,540
I'm fine.

149
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,610
What? What do you mean, you're fine?

150
00:08:55,140 --> 00:08:56,510
Didn't you call me about the news article?

151
00:08:56,970 --> 00:08:57,980
What article?

152
00:09:00,950 --> 00:09:03,579
I've only been getting calls from people worried about me,

153
00:09:03,580 --> 00:09:05,220
so hearing from you is a relief.

154
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:08,090
What are you talking about? Did something happen to you?

155
00:09:08,550 --> 00:09:10,790
Never mind. Why did you call me at this hour?

156
00:09:11,860 --> 00:09:15,630
I just wanted to hear your voice one last time before I leave.

157
00:09:15,790 --> 00:09:17,730
You just finished filming. Where are you going?

158
00:09:19,830 --> 00:09:21,230
I quit my job.

159
00:09:21,630 --> 00:09:22,630
What?

160
00:09:22,900 --> 00:09:25,039
Why would you quit before the first episode even airs?

161
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:26,070
That would be such a waste.

162
00:09:26,900 --> 00:09:29,040
I think I've been living my life all wrong.

163
00:09:29,670 --> 00:09:30,680
And you're just realising that now?

164
00:09:30,980 --> 00:09:31,980
Exactly.

165
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:35,210
So I'm thinking of going to Egypt.

166
00:09:35,810 --> 00:09:37,250
They have a lot of tombs there, you know.

167
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:39,980
What are you even talking about right now? Seriously.

168
00:09:41,790 --> 00:09:44,660
Hey, instead of Egypt, how about Gyeongseong?

169
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:45,720
Come to our set.

170
00:09:46,220 --> 00:09:47,290
What?

171
00:09:47,590 --> 00:09:49,960
Hey, what would I do there?

172
00:09:51,030 --> 00:09:53,430
Tomorrow, I have to film alone without Woo Su Bin.

173
00:09:53,500 --> 00:09:55,399
Come and do something. Anything. Please?

174
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:56,730
Wait, why will you be by yourself?

175
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:01,070
Hey, hold on. Let me look it up.

176
00:10:01,540 --> 00:10:03,070
(Gyeongseong Love Song)

177
00:10:03,170 --> 00:10:04,580
("Gyeongseong Love Song Was a Family Project?")

178
00:10:07,410 --> 00:10:09,180
Hey, what is this?

179
00:10:09,450 --> 00:10:12,050
See? Whether you want to die or live,

180
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:14,050
come do it at our set. I'll let you do whatever you want.

181
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,320
Perfect.

182
00:10:16,050 --> 00:10:18,019
You must be really frantic right now.

183
00:10:18,020 --> 00:10:19,920
I want to feel frantic too.

184
00:10:20,290 --> 00:10:23,190
- I'm on my way. Wait for me. - Hurry up.

185
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,000
Let's go.

186
00:10:27,060 --> 00:10:31,440
(Airport Bus)

187
00:10:35,610 --> 00:10:36,610
And then...

188
00:10:43,950 --> 00:10:46,350
Director Joo, you look a bit tired.

189
00:10:46,950 --> 00:10:48,790
You should try to get some sleep on the way.

190
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,720
I'm okay.

191
00:10:57,060 --> 00:10:58,060
Producer Nam.

192
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:00,900
I can do this, right?

193
00:11:02,030 --> 00:11:04,200
It's my first time alone without Director Woo.

194
00:11:05,070 --> 00:11:06,440
To be honest, I slept even worse last night...

195
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:07,840
than I did before our first day of shooting.

196
00:11:09,140 --> 00:11:10,780
Just do what you always do.

197
00:11:11,780 --> 00:11:15,050
- I'll do my best to help. - Thank you, Producer Nam.

198
00:11:15,380 --> 00:11:19,580
- CEO Seo will be coming today too. - Really?

199
00:11:24,660 --> 00:11:26,460
Look at this. The angle is off.

200
00:11:26,990 --> 00:11:28,830
- No, this one. - It needs to be higher.

201
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:30,290
- Hello. - Okay.

202
00:11:30,630 --> 00:11:32,159
- Hello. - Hello.

203
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:34,630
Hello.

204
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,270
Hello.

205
00:11:36,830 --> 00:11:39,270
Good morning. Hello.

206
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:42,440
Director, how can you call it a good morning?

207
00:11:43,740 --> 00:11:45,509
In a difficult situation like this,

208
00:11:45,510 --> 00:11:47,780
it's still a good morning because I have all of you with me.

209
00:11:49,710 --> 00:11:51,820
Right, Director Joo is right.

210
00:11:52,380 --> 00:11:55,420
- Director Joo, good morning. - Good morning.

211
00:11:57,350 --> 00:11:59,960
Assistant Director. Thank you for all your hard work...

212
00:12:00,020 --> 00:12:01,790
changing the schedule so suddenly yesterday.

213
00:12:02,230 --> 00:12:05,230
But that's our Assistant Director. You're the SWAT.

214
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:06,660
And you're the master of scheduling.

215
00:12:07,530 --> 00:12:09,800
Well, it's all in a day's work.

216
00:12:09,870 --> 00:12:13,569
Wait, SWA what? Say that again. Let me write that down.

217
00:12:13,570 --> 00:12:17,640
Come on. Smart, With-it, And Tidy.

218
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:20,140
You and I are on the same wavelength.

219
00:12:20,210 --> 00:12:22,010
You have that Gen Z vibe.

220
00:12:22,750 --> 00:12:24,920
Hey, I think our resident Gen Z-er needs reading glasses.

221
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:28,150
- You needed them before me. - Come on.

222
00:12:28,750 --> 00:12:29,750
Don't laugh.

223
00:12:30,490 --> 00:12:31,490
Hey, but...

224
00:12:32,390 --> 00:12:33,390
are we really...

225
00:12:34,260 --> 00:12:35,490
doing this without Director Woo today?

226
00:12:37,500 --> 00:12:39,700
And you don't know when he'll be back, right?

227
00:12:41,030 --> 00:12:42,030
Right.

228
00:12:46,470 --> 00:12:49,340
I know all of you are anxious.

229
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:51,880
It's because of my shortcomings.

230
00:12:52,610 --> 00:12:54,380
But I will work hard so you don't feel...

231
00:12:54,450 --> 00:12:55,550
Director Woo's absence.

232
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:57,920
I will do my best to lead all of you.

233
00:12:58,320 --> 00:13:02,490
- Please trust me. - That's not what I meant. Goodness.

234
00:13:06,560 --> 00:13:08,360
This old and tattered paper...

235
00:13:09,460 --> 00:13:11,030
is the manuscript for Gyeongseong Love Song.

236
00:13:11,900 --> 00:13:14,470
I've carried it in my bag every time I've come to the set.

237
00:13:16,470 --> 00:13:19,040
So that I would not forget the passion I had...

238
00:13:19,970 --> 00:13:21,010
when I first wrote this story.

239
00:13:23,140 --> 00:13:24,580
To me, this movie...

240
00:13:26,980 --> 00:13:28,350
is a long-held dream.

241
00:13:29,350 --> 00:13:32,219
To be on this journey with you all...

242
00:13:32,220 --> 00:13:33,920
is more reassuring than you know.

243
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:39,920
That's why I will never waver.

244
00:13:40,890 --> 00:13:43,430
With all of you, I will absolutely...

245
00:13:44,500 --> 00:13:46,030
see this through to the very end.

246
00:13:47,330 --> 00:13:48,730
Seeing this through to the end together.

247
00:13:49,870 --> 00:13:51,270
That in itself is a great achievement.

248
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:55,210
Especially at a time like this, we should be a team...

249
00:13:55,570 --> 00:13:57,270
and trust one another as we move forward.

250
00:13:58,610 --> 00:13:59,610
I'm asking for your support.

251
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,320
Quiet!

252
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:15,590
I heard from Director Woo.

253
00:14:16,930 --> 00:14:18,500
He said you started writing this as a high school senior.

254
00:14:20,460 --> 00:14:23,230
I've had this dream since I was a kid too,

255
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,870
and the number of stories I have stashed in my drawer...

256
00:14:26,370 --> 00:14:27,970
is in the hundreds, Director.

257
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:30,870
But Director,

258
00:14:32,540 --> 00:14:34,580
you never gave up on yours.

259
00:14:35,980 --> 00:14:37,050
What's with him?

260
00:14:37,350 --> 00:14:38,780
A director like you...

261
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:40,480
is someone I can trust.

262
00:14:42,090 --> 00:14:43,690
Isn't that right, everyone?

263
00:14:44,220 --> 00:14:45,920
- Yes! - Yes!

264
00:14:46,860 --> 00:14:48,160
Let's do this!

265
00:14:50,430 --> 00:14:51,630
- Joo Yi Jae! - Joo Yi Jae!

266
00:14:51,830 --> 00:14:54,400
- Joo Yi Jae! - Let's do this!

267
00:14:54,500 --> 00:14:55,500
Let's do this!

268
00:14:56,930 --> 00:14:58,700
- Now you're going to make her cry. - I'm tearing up.

269
00:14:59,900 --> 00:15:01,710
- Let's go! - Let's go!

270
00:15:02,210 --> 00:15:03,210
You're so beautiful!

271
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:07,810
The number of extras we have secured so far...

272
00:15:08,310 --> 00:15:10,150
is 19, including Producer Nam.

273
00:15:10,450 --> 00:15:13,250
It'd be nice to have one or two more in Western clothes.

274
00:15:13,950 --> 00:15:16,950
Producer Nam said she'd try to convince CEO Seo.

275
00:15:18,260 --> 00:15:19,990
- CEO Seo? - Yes.

276
00:15:21,260 --> 00:15:22,590
Joo Yi Jae!

277
00:15:25,130 --> 00:15:27,360
Director Joo!

278
00:15:29,830 --> 00:15:32,869
- What is all this? - I'm here now. Just say the word.

279
00:15:32,870 --> 00:15:36,310
I'll help with anything. It's been too long.

280
00:15:36,810 --> 00:15:38,880
- How have you been? - Not good.

281
00:15:38,940 --> 00:15:41,910
Why? Who's giving you a hard time?

282
00:15:46,650 --> 00:15:48,390
You want me to be an extra?

283
00:15:49,590 --> 00:15:52,320
We need at least 20 people, but we're short.

284
00:15:52,790 --> 00:15:55,530
As you know, the schedule changed last night.

285
00:15:59,700 --> 00:16:02,169
Well, it's an unforeseeable situation,

286
00:16:02,170 --> 00:16:03,670
so I'm sure she'll understand.

287
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:05,800
Well then, I'll be off.

288
00:16:06,070 --> 00:16:08,210
Come on, CEO Seo.

289
00:16:09,170 --> 00:16:11,040
I'm here as a producer.

290
00:16:11,310 --> 00:16:13,010
I'm a producer too.

291
00:16:13,540 --> 00:16:15,480
Just this once. Please?

292
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:19,380
Honestly. Because you were off filming that dating show,

293
00:16:19,450 --> 00:16:20,950
you've been neglecting the set.

294
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:25,190
- I told you that's a secret. - Why are you looking around?

295
00:16:25,460 --> 00:16:28,790
Hurry. Get changed and get ready.

296
00:16:29,660 --> 00:16:31,860
You think this is only my problem?

297
00:16:33,330 --> 00:16:36,570
Director Joo must be anxious.

298
00:16:36,630 --> 00:16:38,700
At least we should help her.

299
00:16:49,250 --> 00:16:51,450
"He captures the hearts of Gyeongseong's modern girls,"

300
00:16:51,520 --> 00:16:53,120
"but he is unaware."

301
00:16:53,950 --> 00:16:56,390
"He believes the world is a beautiful place,"

302
00:16:56,650 --> 00:16:58,420
"then meets a tragic end..."

303
00:16:59,060 --> 00:17:00,190
That kind of modern boy?

304
00:17:00,260 --> 00:17:03,930
Yes, good. That's it. Just get shot and die like that.

305
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:05,260
Got it?

306
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:09,570
Excuse me.

307
00:17:10,330 --> 00:17:11,970
Where is the dressing room?

308
00:17:14,410 --> 00:17:16,309
You can change in the waiting room.

309
00:17:16,310 --> 00:17:17,570
Thank you.

310
00:17:25,220 --> 00:17:28,590
Joo Yi Jae is making a television writer act.

311
00:17:34,530 --> 00:17:37,130
Oh, I'm already feeling sad.

312
00:17:38,260 --> 00:17:42,930
Looks like the top female singer at a Gyeongseong club...

313
00:17:43,670 --> 00:17:45,069
who's blessed with both brains and beauty,

314
00:17:45,070 --> 00:17:46,440
but fated to live a tragic life.

315
00:17:48,410 --> 00:17:49,709
If I have to die, fine.

316
00:17:49,710 --> 00:17:52,440
But I want to take a Japanese soldier down with me.

317
00:17:56,280 --> 00:17:57,350
My apologies.

318
00:18:03,790 --> 00:18:06,220
No, it can't be...

319
00:18:12,530 --> 00:18:15,230
Load. Fire!

320
00:18:24,640 --> 00:18:26,780
Eun Seo? What are you doing...

321
00:18:33,750 --> 00:18:34,820
Sa Rang...

322
00:18:38,990 --> 00:18:39,990
Cut!

323
00:18:40,560 --> 00:18:42,460
What are you two doing?

324
00:18:42,530 --> 00:18:45,160
Hey, the director said cut. Why is the corpse moving?

325
00:18:45,230 --> 00:18:47,530
Who was that? Who just moved?

326
00:18:47,870 --> 00:18:50,130
- I'm sorry. - Oh, my. CEO Seo?

327
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:51,340
I'm sorry.

328
00:18:52,670 --> 00:18:54,140
I'm sorry.

329
00:18:54,610 --> 00:18:55,610
Writer Choi.

330
00:18:56,470 --> 00:18:58,710
- I'm sorry. - Sa Rang.

331
00:19:05,180 --> 00:19:06,780
I had no idea...

332
00:19:07,450 --> 00:19:10,489
that Yi Jae's movie was produced by your company.

333
00:19:10,490 --> 00:19:11,590
Me too.

334
00:19:12,490 --> 00:19:16,290
I never thought we would meet again on a dirt floor, playing dead.

335
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:23,470
No matter where or how we ran into each other,

336
00:19:27,370 --> 00:19:29,570
I promised myself I would just give you the cold shoulder...

337
00:19:30,370 --> 00:19:31,880
without a glance or a greeting.

338
00:19:36,180 --> 00:19:38,720
So this all feels very pointless right now.

339
00:19:43,450 --> 00:19:46,160
- Pointless? - Why did we break up?

340
00:19:48,260 --> 00:19:49,790
Before we part ways for good,

341
00:19:49,860 --> 00:19:51,760
I hope you can at least tell me that.

342
00:19:58,170 --> 00:19:59,940
Just like I've always done,

343
00:20:00,300 --> 00:20:01,739
I thought it would be easy and jumped in,

344
00:20:01,740 --> 00:20:03,070
but I got seriously burned.

345
00:20:05,010 --> 00:20:08,280
In Wook, you keep making my life difficult.

346
00:20:09,710 --> 00:20:11,720
You break all my rules,

347
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:14,050
and my predictions are always wrong.

348
00:20:19,220 --> 00:20:22,230
What if it's because you are in love with me?

349
00:20:25,730 --> 00:20:27,300
If this is love,

350
00:20:32,270 --> 00:20:34,300
I don't think I can handle it.

351
00:20:36,240 --> 00:20:37,470
Because I...

352
00:20:38,410 --> 00:20:40,080
still like things to be easy.

353
00:20:43,580 --> 00:20:44,880
I understand.

354
00:20:45,780 --> 00:20:48,390
It's hard for me to comprehend,

355
00:20:49,450 --> 00:20:51,150
but I can accept it.

356
00:20:52,660 --> 00:20:53,720
All right, then.

357
00:20:55,530 --> 00:20:57,330
Sa Rang, let us part ways here.

358
00:21:00,230 --> 00:21:01,500
Take care.

359
00:21:04,330 --> 00:21:06,240
Why are you talking like that?

360
00:21:07,470 --> 00:21:10,440
It must be the power of this outfit.

361
00:21:14,310 --> 00:21:16,250
You're so like yourself, right to the very end.

362
00:21:17,080 --> 00:21:18,120
Take care.

363
00:21:19,050 --> 00:21:20,320
I mean it.

364
00:21:22,220 --> 00:21:25,960
Since this is the end, why don't you go first, In Wook?

365
00:21:27,890 --> 00:21:29,590
After all, as for seeing someone from behind,

366
00:21:30,460 --> 00:21:32,560
you are more beautiful than I am, Sa Rang.

367
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:34,200
Shall we...

368
00:21:34,870 --> 00:21:37,430
end this on a beautiful note?

369
00:21:37,470 --> 00:21:39,770
I like the sight of your back too.

370
00:21:40,670 --> 00:21:41,770
Have you forgotten?

371
00:21:42,070 --> 00:21:45,080
- How we met? - This is a real toss-up, isn't it?

372
00:21:47,310 --> 00:21:49,910
Then shall we turn around at the same time?

373
00:21:50,580 --> 00:21:51,680
Okay.

374
00:21:53,580 --> 00:21:54,580
One.

375
00:21:55,390 --> 00:21:56,390
Two.

376
00:21:57,490 --> 00:21:58,490
Three.

377
00:23:07,160 --> 00:23:09,130
Instead of a gun in your hand,

378
00:23:11,600 --> 00:23:13,760
you should have been holding mine.

379
00:23:17,030 --> 00:23:18,840
I couldn't even protect you.

380
00:23:19,970 --> 00:23:23,069
Cut. Mu Gyeom, move a little more in front of the flag...

381
00:23:23,070 --> 00:23:24,070
and then crumple the telegram.

382
00:23:24,980 --> 00:23:26,880
Cut. Let's go again.

383
00:23:27,310 --> 00:23:29,950
- Okay. - I couldn't even protect you.

384
00:23:30,010 --> 00:23:32,050
- Cut. - I couldn't even protect you.

385
00:23:32,120 --> 00:23:33,980
- Cut. - I couldn't even protect you.

386
00:23:34,050 --> 00:23:35,050
Cut.

387
00:23:36,220 --> 00:23:37,690
So how can I protect my country?

388
00:23:37,790 --> 00:23:41,260
Cut. Let's do it again. Mu Gyeom, the telegram was out of frame,

389
00:23:41,320 --> 00:23:42,590
so hold it up a little higher.

390
00:23:43,190 --> 00:23:44,830
So how can I protect my country?

391
00:23:47,260 --> 00:23:48,270
Cut.

392
00:23:48,930 --> 00:23:50,330
I've been watching, and I think...

393
00:23:50,400 --> 00:23:52,300
you should turn around, walk to the table,

394
00:23:52,370 --> 00:23:53,700
and end the scene there.

395
00:23:58,710 --> 00:23:59,710
Cut.

396
00:24:01,780 --> 00:24:03,550
Let's do it again. I'm sorry, everyone.

397
00:24:03,610 --> 00:24:04,979
Let's do it one more time.

398
00:24:04,980 --> 00:24:06,420
Well...

399
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:10,520
For your blocking, do what you did last time and come here,

400
00:24:10,590 --> 00:24:12,489
but if you lean over too much, you'll cast a big shadow.

401
00:24:12,490 --> 00:24:13,490
So lift your head a bit.

402
00:24:13,491 --> 00:24:15,690
And for the emotion, just do what you did...

403
00:24:15,790 --> 00:24:17,060
in the first take.

404
00:24:19,760 --> 00:24:20,800
Yi Jae.

405
00:24:21,430 --> 00:24:22,470
It's okay.

406
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:24,430
Calm down.

407
00:24:26,470 --> 00:24:27,470
Okay.

408
00:24:29,040 --> 00:24:30,510
Let's do it one more time.

409
00:24:30,870 --> 00:24:32,310
Let's do it one more time.

410
00:24:33,240 --> 00:24:36,050
"She built this image of being a good mom,"

411
00:24:36,110 --> 00:24:38,420
"but she had a secret son the whole time."

412
00:24:38,880 --> 00:24:40,450
"I just feel bad for the son."

413
00:24:40,750 --> 00:24:43,649
"The adulteress Ahn Soo Hee should just retire."

414
00:24:43,650 --> 00:24:47,290
"Her face says it all. She looks so malicious."

415
00:24:47,860 --> 00:24:50,390
- That's all for now. - I'm going to live a long life.

416
00:24:51,430 --> 00:24:53,359
- Next. - The most urgent issue is...

417
00:24:53,360 --> 00:24:55,170
Ha Na's endorsement deals.

418
00:24:55,330 --> 00:24:58,800
Cosmetics, sportswear, cell phones, and even the bank...

419
00:24:58,870 --> 00:25:00,670
are all threatening to terminate their contracts.

420
00:25:00,740 --> 00:25:04,070
What ridiculous threats. What did Ha Na do wrong?

421
00:25:04,210 --> 00:25:07,840
Well, advertisers are the most sensitive to public reaction.

422
00:25:07,910 --> 00:25:10,509
Right now, there are more posts online about Ha Na...

423
00:25:10,510 --> 00:25:12,620
than you or Director Ian.

424
00:25:12,950 --> 00:25:15,650
Feuds with co-stars, accusations of power abuse,

425
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:17,250
and even the controversy over her acting skills...

426
00:25:17,320 --> 00:25:18,320
are resurfacing.

427
00:25:18,360 --> 00:25:19,990
They think now's their chance, those vultures.

428
00:25:20,860 --> 00:25:22,889
Announce that we're taking legal action.

429
00:25:22,890 --> 00:25:23,930
- Yes, ma'am. - Yes, ma'am.

430
00:25:25,630 --> 00:25:26,930
And Team Leader Han.

431
00:25:27,360 --> 00:25:28,730
Tell Director Kang...

432
00:25:29,500 --> 00:25:32,140
to come crawling to me before I go looking for him.

433
00:25:32,600 --> 00:25:33,600
Pardon?

434
00:25:34,540 --> 00:25:35,910
Why should I be the one to...

435
00:25:37,170 --> 00:25:38,209
You want to know why?

436
00:25:38,210 --> 00:25:40,410
- I wouldn't be saying nice things. - No.

437
00:25:41,110 --> 00:25:42,410
I'll be sure to tell him.

438
00:25:43,980 --> 00:25:45,150
Everyone, get out.

439
00:25:53,060 --> 00:25:56,230
Oh, hey. Where is Ha Na?

440
00:25:56,690 --> 00:25:58,700
I really don't know, ma'am.

441
00:25:59,260 --> 00:26:02,930
She knew you'd see right through me if I lied,

442
00:26:03,070 --> 00:26:05,300
so she didn't tell me anything.

443
00:26:06,970 --> 00:26:08,440
This is unbelievable.

444
00:26:10,070 --> 00:26:11,370
Is Ha Na...

445
00:26:12,040 --> 00:26:13,510
in contact with you?

446
00:26:14,140 --> 00:26:15,849
Check on her and report to me every hour.

447
00:26:15,850 --> 00:26:17,410
- Got it? - Yes.

448
00:26:24,920 --> 00:26:26,620
(Oh Ha Na is a total nepo baby. Seeing her fail is so satisfying.)

449
00:26:26,690 --> 00:26:28,330
(What's a nepo baby?)

450
00:26:28,360 --> 00:26:29,960
(A term for kids who get famous from their parents' influence.)

451
00:26:30,030 --> 00:26:31,630
(She got dragged for her acting, now for her family drama.)

452
00:26:31,700 --> 00:26:33,060
(She's not lead quality. Why else has she always been the lead?)

453
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:34,400
(Like mother, like daughter. It's so obvious.)

454
00:26:34,460 --> 00:26:35,730
(She should just retire. I'm sick of seeing her.)

455
00:26:44,240 --> 00:26:45,640
(Friend, Sim Yu Geon)

456
00:26:45,940 --> 00:26:48,010
You can eat anything in the fridge.

457
00:26:48,450 --> 00:26:51,150
Don't starve yourself. Make sure you eat well.

458
00:26:51,180 --> 00:26:53,520
How could I possibly have an appetite right now?

459
00:27:05,800 --> 00:27:06,960
(Chicken Breast Sausage)

460
00:27:07,730 --> 00:27:09,300
What am I supposed to eat?

461
00:27:24,910 --> 00:27:26,450
He didn't throw it away.

462
00:27:29,620 --> 00:27:32,790
I think I need this right now. His shoulder to lean on.

463
00:27:47,940 --> 00:27:49,040
Oh Ha Na.

464
00:27:49,770 --> 00:27:50,770
It's me.

465
00:27:55,110 --> 00:27:56,110
What?

466
00:27:57,010 --> 00:27:58,650
I get hungry even if everyone hates me.

467
00:27:58,920 --> 00:27:59,920
Right.

468
00:28:00,850 --> 00:28:02,050
Chew your food well.

469
00:28:07,760 --> 00:28:10,130
If you're just going to sit there in silence, why did you even come?

470
00:28:10,230 --> 00:28:11,230
Right.

471
00:28:12,730 --> 00:28:15,029
- I'm taking care of myself. - You're what?

472
00:28:15,030 --> 00:28:16,170
Yi Jae told me to.

473
00:28:16,470 --> 00:28:18,500
And she told me to look after you too.

474
00:28:22,710 --> 00:28:25,480
I think I've taken care of myself enough.

475
00:28:25,710 --> 00:28:27,280
So, how should I take care of you?

476
00:28:28,010 --> 00:28:29,050
What are you talking about?

477
00:28:29,410 --> 00:28:32,250
I was wondering why I disliked you so much from the start,

478
00:28:32,280 --> 00:28:33,820
and it's because my body was rejecting you.

479
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:36,750
No. You just don't like me.

480
00:28:36,820 --> 00:28:40,260
- That's right. You're so obnoxious. - So are you.

481
00:28:41,160 --> 00:28:43,829
I'm already miserable being the entire nation's punching bag,

482
00:28:43,830 --> 00:28:45,060
so did you come here to pick a fight?

483
00:28:46,430 --> 00:28:47,930
You haven't developed a thick skin yet?

484
00:28:47,960 --> 00:28:49,330
You've been a star your whole life.

485
00:28:49,400 --> 00:28:50,630
I didn't know...

486
00:28:51,800 --> 00:28:53,800
I came off as this unlikeable.

487
00:28:54,440 --> 00:28:55,610
Everyone's bad-mouthing me...

488
00:28:55,670 --> 00:28:57,670
like they've been waiting for this very moment.

489
00:28:59,180 --> 00:29:00,980
They act like I deserve all this hate...

490
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:03,280
just because I had it easy thanks to my mother.

491
00:29:03,510 --> 00:29:04,510
Oh Ha Na.

492
00:29:07,250 --> 00:29:09,150
Don't misdirect your anger.

493
00:29:10,890 --> 00:29:12,859
You're not upset due to the public right now.

494
00:29:12,860 --> 00:29:14,160
It's because of CEO Ahn.

495
00:29:15,230 --> 00:29:17,530
CEO Ahn was hoping you would never find out.

496
00:29:18,290 --> 00:29:19,960
That's why she came to see me,

497
00:29:20,030 --> 00:29:22,200
and she happened to run into my father.

498
00:29:22,630 --> 00:29:25,770
- That conversation was recorded. - Why shouldn't I have known?

499
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:29,940
- Am I not family? - Because you are family.

500
00:29:32,140 --> 00:29:33,380
Because you and CEO Ahn...

501
00:29:34,380 --> 00:29:35,680
are family.

502
00:29:38,720 --> 00:29:41,280
That's why I also thought you didn't need to know.

503
00:29:44,390 --> 00:29:46,090
Nothing will change going forward.

504
00:29:49,430 --> 00:29:53,430
I think you'll need time to accept it.

505
00:29:57,430 --> 00:29:58,800
I won't rush you.

506
00:29:59,740 --> 00:30:01,870
Once you've had time to take care of yourself,

507
00:30:02,270 --> 00:30:03,770
we can get back on set.

508
00:30:06,140 --> 00:30:07,140
Sleep well.

509
00:30:08,410 --> 00:30:09,410
I'll be back tomorrow.

510
00:30:13,550 --> 00:30:15,720
Wait, why are you coming back tomorrow?

511
00:30:19,490 --> 00:30:22,360
I'll come every day until you agree to get back to filming.

512
00:30:22,730 --> 00:30:24,430
Gosh, honestly.

513
00:30:25,960 --> 00:30:27,459
Sim Yu Geon, if he knew this would happen,

514
00:30:27,460 --> 00:30:28,900
why did he send me here?

515
00:30:29,230 --> 00:30:30,830
He said no one would come looking for me.

516
00:30:35,310 --> 00:30:37,410
To find out where you were,

517
00:30:37,670 --> 00:30:39,440
I had to put up with all his whining.

518
00:30:39,510 --> 00:30:42,650
- Sim Yu Geon can get cranky? - He's not that great of a person.

519
00:30:43,310 --> 00:30:46,579
- Are you any better? - What? What did you just say?

520
00:30:46,580 --> 00:30:48,119
- Director. - Right.

521
00:30:48,120 --> 00:30:50,820
I'm the director. Is there anything you want to eat?

522
00:30:52,290 --> 00:30:54,260
- I'll pick it up on my way. - Director.

523
00:30:55,490 --> 00:30:56,890
I'm not going to die.

524
00:30:58,190 --> 00:31:00,300
You know how hard I worked for the role of Nan Yeong?

525
00:31:02,500 --> 00:31:05,270
So, just stop acting so out of character.

526
00:31:08,300 --> 00:31:09,310
All right.

527
00:31:09,940 --> 00:31:10,940
That's a relief.

528
00:31:12,240 --> 00:31:13,240
Oh Ha Na.

529
00:31:13,980 --> 00:31:17,150
Let's work toward a happy ending together.

530
00:31:17,950 --> 00:31:18,950
See you tomorrow.

531
00:31:39,640 --> 00:31:42,970
I'm on my way to see CEO Ahn now. I'll do my best to persuade her.

532
00:31:44,870 --> 00:31:48,040
CEO Park, you need to convince those investors too.

533
00:31:48,080 --> 00:31:49,080
So we can buy some time.

534
00:31:49,081 --> 00:31:52,580
Hey, CEO Seo. Just buying time won't solve anything.

535
00:31:52,780 --> 00:31:55,120
Tell CEO Ahn to release an official statement immediately.

536
00:31:55,180 --> 00:31:57,050
Does she think this will go away if she hides?

537
00:31:57,520 --> 00:31:58,790
I understand.

538
00:32:00,120 --> 00:32:02,029
I'll call you back.

539
00:32:02,030 --> 00:32:03,060
Okay.

540
00:32:13,470 --> 00:32:16,670
CEO Ahn, it's already been a week.

541
00:32:16,710 --> 00:32:19,340
And the investors are in an uproar, saying they can't wait any longer.

542
00:32:20,380 --> 00:32:22,050
They've waited a week.

543
00:32:22,910 --> 00:32:24,250
Can't they wait two?

544
00:32:24,280 --> 00:32:28,650
Public opinion keeps getting worse. Everyone's demanding...

545
00:32:28,750 --> 00:32:30,290
that you release a statement right away.

546
00:32:38,560 --> 00:32:39,760
Demanding what?

547
00:32:40,530 --> 00:32:43,230
I'm the main investor. They put in a little bit of money...

548
00:32:43,270 --> 00:32:44,870
and think they can tell me what to do?

549
00:32:46,340 --> 00:32:50,910
But this isn't just about the money.

550
00:32:51,310 --> 00:32:53,610
The credibility of our film is at stake.

551
00:32:54,010 --> 00:32:55,710
The longer you remain silent,

552
00:32:56,480 --> 00:32:58,310
the more aggressive the media gets.

553
00:32:58,450 --> 00:33:00,080
The moment I admit to it,

554
00:33:01,080 --> 00:33:03,590
I'll be throwing myself to the starved wolves.

555
00:33:04,690 --> 00:33:06,420
You want me to do that now?

556
00:33:07,220 --> 00:33:09,090
I've been in this business for years.

557
00:33:09,130 --> 00:33:11,460
A scandal like this will just blow over.

558
00:33:12,430 --> 00:33:14,000
Then at least take a look at this.

559
00:33:15,030 --> 00:33:17,699
It's a notice from the investment group,

560
00:33:17,700 --> 00:33:19,240
suspending further funding.

561
00:33:21,370 --> 00:33:23,840
CEO Ahn, you need to make a decision now.

562
00:33:24,810 --> 00:33:25,980
Otherwise,

563
00:33:26,680 --> 00:33:28,980
The production will be put on hold immediately.

564
00:33:38,050 --> 00:33:39,860
- Hey, bring the slate. - Yes.

565
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:40,920
Thank you.

566
00:33:46,060 --> 00:33:48,360
Director Joo, where should we set up the rickshaw?

567
00:33:48,430 --> 00:33:51,869
The rickshaw? Over at that end would be good.

568
00:33:51,870 --> 00:33:53,870
- Okay. - Thank you.

569
00:33:54,400 --> 00:33:55,569
Let's get the wide shot first.

570
00:33:55,570 --> 00:33:57,039
Gwang Il, we're doing a dolly shot here,

571
00:33:57,040 --> 00:33:58,840
so cut the light on the wheels.

572
00:34:00,110 --> 00:34:02,250
It's snowing.

573
00:34:02,310 --> 00:34:06,180
- Is this any time to be happy? - It's snowing.

574
00:34:06,250 --> 00:34:08,050
- Gosh. - Director.

575
00:34:08,480 --> 00:34:10,419
Director, what should we do? Should we stand by?

576
00:34:10,420 --> 00:34:12,490
Director Joo, what do you think? Should we shoot indoors first?

577
00:34:12,520 --> 00:34:14,220
It looks like it's going to accumulate quickly, Director.

578
00:34:24,600 --> 00:34:27,640
Okay, for now, let's...

579
00:34:28,400 --> 00:34:30,010
Let's hold for 30 minutes.

580
00:34:30,370 --> 00:34:33,210
All right, 30-minute hold. Cover everything with plastic.

581
00:34:33,310 --> 00:34:35,750
- It's a 30-minute hold. - Move quickly!

582
00:34:36,050 --> 00:34:37,510
Let's move!

583
00:34:38,310 --> 00:34:40,980
Cover everything with plastic.

584
00:34:41,620 --> 00:34:42,620
Okay.

585
00:35:19,260 --> 00:35:20,460
Director Joo!

586
00:35:22,860 --> 00:35:24,060
Director Joo.

587
00:35:29,670 --> 00:35:30,870
Everyone,

588
00:35:31,370 --> 00:35:34,640
production on our film, Gyeongseong Love Song,

589
00:35:35,510 --> 00:35:37,310
is being temporarily suspended.

590
00:35:41,240 --> 00:35:43,110
Due to a number of circumstances,

591
00:35:44,210 --> 00:35:46,620
there's been a problem with our funding.

592
00:35:47,380 --> 00:35:50,420
Your wages will be calculated up to today's date,

593
00:35:50,490 --> 00:35:52,260
and they are scheduled to be paid.

594
00:35:52,560 --> 00:35:54,960
So you don't need to worry about that.

595
00:35:58,130 --> 00:36:01,560
As your director, I am terribly ashamed.

596
00:36:03,430 --> 00:36:05,200
I'll resolve this as quickly as possible...

597
00:36:06,800 --> 00:36:08,440
so that all of you can return.

598
00:36:09,140 --> 00:36:10,440
I'll do my very best.

599
00:36:12,240 --> 00:36:14,910
I'm so sorry.

600
00:36:16,310 --> 00:36:17,480
Director.

601
00:36:20,020 --> 00:36:21,580
What are we going to do?

602
00:36:24,920 --> 00:36:26,320
Unbelievable.

603
00:36:28,220 --> 00:36:31,060
Hey, do you want to go to Director Jeong's set with me?

604
00:36:32,800 --> 00:36:35,830
- Is there an opening? - Seriously, you guys.

605
00:36:35,930 --> 00:36:37,330
You should come too.

606
00:36:37,630 --> 00:36:39,570
You worked directly under Director Jeong.

607
00:36:39,740 --> 00:36:41,470
Show some loyalty.

608
00:36:42,370 --> 00:36:44,010
We should wait at least a week.

609
00:36:44,070 --> 00:36:47,910
I'm just trying to make a living, so I have to look out for myself.

610
00:36:48,480 --> 00:36:50,310
Fine. You can do that.

611
00:36:51,610 --> 00:36:53,880
We can't stop you.

612
00:36:54,450 --> 00:36:56,590
But the snow is nice.

613
00:36:57,090 --> 00:36:58,690
This is pretty bittersweet.

614
00:36:59,120 --> 00:37:01,020
And just when I thought we were finally...

615
00:37:01,090 --> 00:37:02,790
getting in sync with Director Joo.

616
00:37:03,160 --> 00:37:06,430
It really passed by like a fleeting dream.

617
00:37:07,330 --> 00:37:08,760
I'll come back.

618
00:37:11,630 --> 00:37:13,800
Didn't we promise our Director Joo...

619
00:37:16,740 --> 00:37:18,070
that we'd stick together until the end?

620
00:37:19,780 --> 00:37:21,340
DP, wait.

621
00:37:24,350 --> 00:37:26,080
Baek Ho, wait for me!

622
00:37:57,750 --> 00:37:58,880
Ready.

623
00:37:59,750 --> 00:38:00,820
Action!

624
00:38:06,460 --> 00:38:09,789
- Joo Yi Jae! - Let's do this!

625
00:38:09,790 --> 00:38:11,460
Let's do this!

626
00:38:23,870 --> 00:38:25,940
(Gyeongseong Love Song)

627
00:38:38,290 --> 00:38:41,560
(Gyeongseong Love Song)

628
00:38:43,830 --> 00:38:46,000
(Gyeongseong Love Song)

629
00:38:49,730 --> 00:38:50,730
Yi Jae.

630
00:39:37,950 --> 00:39:43,820
(Gyeongseong Love Song)

631
00:39:56,270 --> 00:39:58,870
Yi Jae. I'm off to see CEO Ahn.

632
00:40:00,140 --> 00:40:01,140
Don't worry.

633
00:40:01,740 --> 00:40:03,170
I'll set everything right.

634
00:40:07,010 --> 00:40:09,150
You asked me why I cast Ha Na, correct?

635
00:40:11,150 --> 00:40:12,250
Ha Na said...

636
00:40:13,680 --> 00:40:15,520
her world felt like a prison.

637
00:40:16,590 --> 00:40:19,560
So like Nan Yeong, she wanted to blow up that prison herself...

638
00:40:20,460 --> 00:40:22,390
and finally get her happy ending.

639
00:40:23,560 --> 00:40:26,400
That is why I cast Ha Na.

640
00:40:28,460 --> 00:40:30,000
Because I, too, am someone...

641
00:40:32,170 --> 00:40:34,200
who understands that kind of life better than anyone.

642
00:40:42,140 --> 00:40:43,650
What do you think?

643
00:40:44,310 --> 00:40:45,580
Do you think Ha Na can have her happy ending...

644
00:40:45,820 --> 00:40:47,480
as she is now?

645
00:40:48,320 --> 00:40:49,350
Are you...

646
00:40:50,390 --> 00:40:52,120
threatening me with Ha Na right now?

647
00:40:52,150 --> 00:40:54,020
Asking you to wish for your daughter's happiness...

648
00:40:55,590 --> 00:40:57,060
sounds like a threat to you?

649
00:40:59,730 --> 00:41:00,830
The moment I...

650
00:41:01,730 --> 00:41:03,069
admit to it,

651
00:41:03,070 --> 00:41:04,930
that's what will bring Ha Na misery.

652
00:41:05,530 --> 00:41:08,039
Do you think people will just accept it...

653
00:41:08,040 --> 00:41:11,440
if we tell the truth? They'll pounce on us.

654
00:41:12,370 --> 00:41:14,210
Why should that matter?

655
00:41:15,140 --> 00:41:18,780
Think carefully about what Ha Na truly wants.

656
00:41:22,380 --> 00:41:25,320
In three days, whether you show up or not,

657
00:41:25,960 --> 00:41:27,990
the press conference will proceed as scheduled.

658
00:41:29,730 --> 00:41:30,730
Hey.

659
00:41:32,390 --> 00:41:36,000
Then why in the world are you doing this?

660
00:41:37,430 --> 00:41:40,700
Why are you trying to bring up something so shameful?

661
00:41:50,750 --> 00:41:51,750
I also...

662
00:41:53,920 --> 00:41:55,580
want to have a happy ending...

663
00:41:57,120 --> 00:41:58,820
with the person I love.

664
00:42:16,910 --> 00:42:17,910
Come in.

665
00:42:21,640 --> 00:42:22,950
Do you want me to do it?

666
00:42:23,910 --> 00:42:24,910
Yes.

667
00:42:31,350 --> 00:42:32,620
What about CEO Ahn?

668
00:42:33,120 --> 00:42:35,160
- Have you heard from her? - No.

669
00:42:36,160 --> 00:42:37,630
Will you be okay on your own?

670
00:42:40,400 --> 00:42:41,400
Woo Su Bin.

671
00:42:42,600 --> 00:42:44,730
Have you thought about what I said?

672
00:42:45,400 --> 00:42:48,170
- There are ways. Crowdfunding... - I know.

673
00:42:49,070 --> 00:42:50,070
I know,

674
00:42:51,670 --> 00:42:53,980
but I came back so I wouldn't run away anymore.

675
00:42:55,410 --> 00:42:59,050
This film I'm making with you is proof of that for me.

676
00:43:00,850 --> 00:43:02,890
I'm going to do everything I can,

677
00:43:03,490 --> 00:43:04,920
and then we can find another way.

678
00:43:06,790 --> 00:43:07,820
Okay.

679
00:43:08,890 --> 00:43:10,960
- And, Yi Jae. - Yes?

680
00:43:11,060 --> 00:43:12,700
You don't know how to tie a tie, do you?

681
00:43:13,630 --> 00:43:15,660
- I don't. - I'll do it.

682
00:43:17,500 --> 00:43:18,500
I can't do it.

683
00:43:34,550 --> 00:43:35,620
Grandma.

684
00:43:37,720 --> 00:43:38,720
You're here?

685
00:43:41,820 --> 00:43:42,860
Where's Mom?

686
00:43:46,860 --> 00:43:47,900
She left.

687
00:43:48,530 --> 00:43:51,030
What? Where to?

688
00:44:02,580 --> 00:44:04,650
She told me to give this to you when you got here.

689
00:44:09,950 --> 00:44:10,950
Su Bin.

690
00:44:12,450 --> 00:44:14,320
Try not to hate her too much.

691
00:44:15,660 --> 00:44:16,960
Hwa Yeon...

692
00:44:19,730 --> 00:44:21,460
went through a lot.

693
00:44:41,520 --> 00:44:44,590
To my beloved son, Su Bin.

694
00:44:44,650 --> 00:44:46,160
(To my beloved son, Su Bin.)

695
00:44:46,890 --> 00:44:48,560
Please forgive me...

696
00:44:52,290 --> 00:44:56,030
for not taking your hand and getting you out of that misery.

697
00:44:57,000 --> 00:44:58,830
Please forgive me.

698
00:45:00,840 --> 00:45:03,340
- It's delicious, right? - Only you look after me, Mom.

699
00:45:03,740 --> 00:45:05,640
Forgive me for being happy

700
00:45:06,180 --> 00:45:10,650
because I had you, even though I knew it would bring me misery.

701
00:45:12,820 --> 00:45:14,480
For not leaving your side,

702
00:45:14,550 --> 00:45:17,220
telling myself you were my only happiness,

703
00:45:17,620 --> 00:45:19,390
please forgive me.

704
00:45:21,020 --> 00:45:22,960
I realised it far too late.

705
00:45:24,760 --> 00:45:25,960
That I was the one...

706
00:45:27,960 --> 00:45:30,800
keeping you trapped in that misery.

707
00:45:33,600 --> 00:45:34,970
My son, Su Bin.

708
00:45:36,970 --> 00:45:38,070
Do not...

709
00:45:39,370 --> 00:45:41,080
forgive me.

710
00:46:09,070 --> 00:46:10,770
(Director Woo Su Bin Official Press Conference Statement)

711
00:46:18,150 --> 00:46:19,580
First, it is true that CEO Ahn Soo Hee...

712
00:46:20,580 --> 00:46:22,180
is the woman who gave birth to me.

713
00:46:24,690 --> 00:46:27,160
However, she has never once been a mother to me.

714
00:46:31,260 --> 00:46:32,460
To me, my mother...

715
00:46:34,460 --> 00:46:36,730
is the one and only person who raised me with love.

716
00:46:39,230 --> 00:46:40,840
I was afraid that even discussing this...

717
00:46:41,940 --> 00:46:43,910
would be painful for my mother.

718
00:46:46,040 --> 00:46:48,340
Despite that, the only reason I am here today...

719
00:46:50,810 --> 00:46:52,380
is that the film I'm currently shooting...

720
00:46:52,750 --> 00:46:54,720
is suffering serious damage.

721
00:46:58,120 --> 00:46:59,990
A film is not mine alone.

722
00:47:00,860 --> 00:47:02,190
It is the culmination of the time and effort...

723
00:47:02,490 --> 00:47:05,230
of countless crew members and actors.

724
00:47:06,830 --> 00:47:09,230
I am here today to prevent all of that hard work...

725
00:47:09,700 --> 00:47:12,900
from being undone by baseless rumours and unsubstantiated claims.

726
00:47:16,310 --> 00:47:17,770
I will answer your questions faithfully.

727
00:47:18,170 --> 00:47:22,810
Director Woo, what do you mean she was never a mother to you?

728
00:47:23,380 --> 00:47:24,880
Please be more specific.

729
00:47:26,550 --> 00:47:28,320
I first found out about my birth mother...

730
00:47:29,350 --> 00:47:30,790
when I was about ten years old.

731
00:47:31,350 --> 00:47:34,320
What I'm saying is that we have had no contact since then.

732
00:47:34,390 --> 00:47:37,230
Does that mean you have no personal relationship with Oh Ha Na either?

733
00:47:37,530 --> 00:47:41,930
Yes. Until this issue arose, Oh Ha Na...

734
00:47:42,000 --> 00:47:43,400
was completely unaware of the relationship...

735
00:47:43,470 --> 00:47:44,470
between myself and CEO Ahn.

736
00:47:44,530 --> 00:47:48,240
There are several allegations online regarding your father.

737
00:47:48,300 --> 00:47:50,010
Are you able to comment on that?

738
00:47:54,310 --> 00:47:56,480
I'm sorry, but I have no comment.

739
00:47:56,550 --> 00:47:58,709
Can you tell us about the relationship...

740
00:47:58,710 --> 00:48:00,380
between CEO Ahn and your father?

741
00:48:00,580 --> 00:48:02,620
Is it true that they had an affair?

742
00:48:02,650 --> 00:48:04,590
How long have you known about this?

743
00:48:04,650 --> 00:48:06,860
Do you feel any sense of responsibility about this matter?

744
00:48:06,920 --> 00:48:09,460
- What did your father have to say? - Please say something.

745
00:48:16,630 --> 00:48:17,670
It's Ahn Soo Hee!

746
00:48:24,940 --> 00:48:26,340
Please tell us the truth!

747
00:48:31,410 --> 00:48:34,150
(Director Woo Su Bin Official Press Conference Statement)

748
00:48:35,220 --> 00:48:38,590
(Director Woo Su Bin Official Press Conference Statement)

749
00:48:38,690 --> 00:48:40,090
I've heard just about enough.

750
00:48:40,490 --> 00:48:43,590
Hey, reporters. You all heard that darn audio file,

751
00:48:44,260 --> 00:48:45,760
so why are your questions so pathetic?

752
00:48:47,600 --> 00:48:48,859
I told you I found out he was married...

753
00:48:48,860 --> 00:48:50,230
after I was pregnant with Director Woo.

754
00:48:50,730 --> 00:48:52,200
I'm a victim here too.

755
00:48:52,570 --> 00:48:55,540
But you demanded a divorce. Doesn't that mean you already knew?

756
00:48:55,970 --> 00:48:56,970
I told him to get a divorce...

757
00:48:57,040 --> 00:48:58,070
because I was planning to have the baby.

758
00:48:58,370 --> 00:49:00,440
But what could I do when the man refused to the bitter end?

759
00:49:04,050 --> 00:49:05,510
I haven't even gotten started yet.

760
00:49:10,020 --> 00:49:11,120
Everyone,

761
00:49:11,190 --> 00:49:13,460
I was a 24-year-old actress back then.

762
00:49:14,090 --> 00:49:17,260
If the world found out I had a child out of wedlock, I would've been...

763
00:49:18,360 --> 00:49:20,060
completely finished.

764
00:49:21,230 --> 00:49:25,070
But now that I'm nearly 60, a scandal like this is no big deal.

765
00:49:26,600 --> 00:49:29,170
I was just going to let it die down,

766
00:49:30,840 --> 00:49:31,840
but...

767
00:49:31,940 --> 00:49:33,310
(Director Woo Su Bin's Press Conference On Recording)

768
00:49:33,380 --> 00:49:35,910
being a mother my Ha Na would be ashamed of.

769
00:49:36,280 --> 00:49:37,810
That's something I just couldn't bear.

770
00:49:39,510 --> 00:49:40,880
Let me say this one last time.

771
00:49:41,420 --> 00:49:43,690
I didn't know that man was married,

772
00:49:44,290 --> 00:49:45,720
he refused to get a divorce,

773
00:49:45,790 --> 00:49:47,790
but insisted I have the baby, so I did,

774
00:49:48,390 --> 00:49:49,420
and after I had the baby,

775
00:49:52,330 --> 00:49:54,230
he just took him away. That's the whole story.

776
00:49:55,430 --> 00:49:57,970
The only person who has the right to criticize me now is my daughter,

777
00:49:59,840 --> 00:50:00,970
Oh Ha Na.

778
00:50:05,410 --> 00:50:06,740
That is all.

779
00:50:17,250 --> 00:50:19,690
CEO Ahn, is that the truth?

780
00:50:23,430 --> 00:50:24,460
Director Woo Su Bin.

781
00:50:25,590 --> 00:50:26,960
A statement, please.

782
00:50:31,970 --> 00:50:34,900
- I was a 24-year-old actress... - Gosh, this is crazy.

783
00:50:35,170 --> 00:50:36,970
Hey, is this really about our director?

784
00:50:37,040 --> 00:50:39,810
- An affair with Ahn Soo Hee? - Gosh, what are we going to do?

785
00:50:39,880 --> 00:50:40,880
Hey.

786
00:50:48,050 --> 00:50:49,450
What's for lunch today?

787
00:50:50,250 --> 00:50:51,549
Marinated grilled beef...

788
00:50:51,550 --> 00:50:53,120
and soybean paste soup with cabbage, I think.

789
00:50:53,190 --> 00:50:54,660
Yes, I believe so.

790
00:50:55,490 --> 00:50:58,230
But are you planning to eat in the cafeteria?

791
00:51:02,060 --> 00:51:05,470
Why? Is there some reason I shouldn't?

792
00:51:06,640 --> 00:51:07,640
No, not at all.

793
00:51:10,970 --> 00:51:13,710
(Grandma's Grilled Fish Set Meal)

794
00:51:13,940 --> 00:51:16,550
Hey, isn't that Ahn Soo Hee?

795
00:51:18,710 --> 00:51:22,220
- No, it can't be. - I think it's her.

796
00:51:22,750 --> 00:51:25,750
She's got nerves of steel.

797
00:51:26,720 --> 00:51:27,860
Don't you think she's a complete wreck...

798
00:51:27,920 --> 00:51:29,190
and that's why she's sitting there alone?

799
00:51:30,090 --> 00:51:31,260
Yes, you're right.

800
00:51:39,870 --> 00:51:40,870
Mom.

801
00:51:41,400 --> 00:51:42,440
I'm here.

802
00:52:03,990 --> 00:52:06,190
Excuse me, could I get another bowl of rice, please?

803
00:52:16,970 --> 00:52:18,810
This place used to be empty every time I came.

804
00:52:22,080 --> 00:52:23,910
I saw your press conference.

805
00:52:26,650 --> 00:52:29,520
- You're insane, Mom. - Yes, I am.

806
00:52:29,990 --> 00:52:31,820
How could I possibly get through this if I were sane?

807
00:52:32,620 --> 00:52:33,620
Exactly.

808
00:52:35,290 --> 00:52:38,030
You must have been so lonely and struggling, Mom.

809
00:52:43,400 --> 00:52:45,230
You once told me...

810
00:52:46,840 --> 00:52:48,800
that I don't know what true misery is.

811
00:52:51,710 --> 00:52:52,840
I think...

812
00:52:53,580 --> 00:52:54,880
I finally understand it now.

813
00:52:57,210 --> 00:52:58,250
I'm sorry, Mom.

814
00:53:03,790 --> 00:53:05,620
I said I didn't want you to be ashamed of me.

815
00:53:06,350 --> 00:53:08,720
I wasn't asking for your pity.

816
00:53:09,760 --> 00:53:11,490
I don't pity you at all, Mom.

817
00:53:12,890 --> 00:53:14,460
I'm disappointed, and I resent you.

818
00:53:16,530 --> 00:53:18,070
But I love you as much as I resent you.

819
00:53:21,940 --> 00:53:24,970
And I know you love me.

820
00:53:27,140 --> 00:53:28,610
You just have a strange way of showing it.

821
00:53:29,140 --> 00:53:30,150
Honestly.

822
00:53:31,680 --> 00:53:33,720
Mom. Can't we just...

823
00:53:34,320 --> 00:53:38,090
be a normal mother and daughter like everyone else?

824
00:53:42,760 --> 00:53:44,290
And how do I do that?

825
00:53:44,890 --> 00:53:46,860
I wouldn't know. I never had that with my own mother.

826
00:53:48,600 --> 00:53:51,070
This is the first I'm hearing about your mom.

827
00:53:56,710 --> 00:53:57,710
So...

828
00:53:58,810 --> 00:54:01,340
what should I do first? Tell me.

829
00:54:02,440 --> 00:54:03,510
I just...

830
00:54:04,980 --> 00:54:06,550
need you to let me go.

831
00:54:07,350 --> 00:54:08,920
I want to try living on my own.

832
00:54:12,050 --> 00:54:14,560
Give me a chance to grow up.

833
00:54:14,720 --> 00:54:18,960
- You are an adult. You're 30. - Exactly. I'm 30 years old,

834
00:54:19,030 --> 00:54:20,960
but there's not a single thing I know how to do.

835
00:54:21,300 --> 00:54:23,570
I've never even cooked a meal for myself,

836
00:54:23,630 --> 00:54:25,269
and I've never cleaned or done laundry.

837
00:54:25,270 --> 00:54:26,270
What's the point?

838
00:54:26,330 --> 00:54:28,240
I raised you so you wouldn't have to do those things.

839
00:54:28,300 --> 00:54:30,270
Not doing something when you know how...

840
00:54:30,910 --> 00:54:32,870
is different from not knowing how at all.

841
00:54:34,480 --> 00:54:35,580
To be honest,

842
00:54:37,410 --> 00:54:39,050
I feel a little ashamed of myself.

843
00:54:39,480 --> 00:54:41,250
That's ridiculous.

844
00:54:43,150 --> 00:54:44,719
You don't know how good you have it.

845
00:54:44,720 --> 00:54:45,750
You're right.

846
00:54:46,220 --> 00:54:49,890
I want to experience for myself just how good I have it.

847
00:54:51,360 --> 00:54:54,600
- Good grief. - Just because I leave your side,

848
00:54:55,060 --> 00:54:56,930
doesn't mean I'm not your daughter.

849
00:54:58,300 --> 00:55:01,900
And who knows? It might make our relationship even closer.

850
00:55:03,810 --> 00:55:04,870
Okay?

851
00:55:05,740 --> 00:55:08,340
Goodness. I thought you'd look haggard from being away,

852
00:55:08,980 --> 00:55:10,310
but your cheeks have gotten even chubbier.

853
00:55:12,680 --> 00:55:15,080
Well, I'm turning your room into my home gym.

854
00:55:16,320 --> 00:55:19,320
Don't you come crying back to me later.

855
00:55:57,990 --> 00:56:00,500
Seriously, you're being unbelievable.

856
00:56:00,930 --> 00:56:02,830
Why is Director Ian stepping down?

857
00:56:02,900 --> 00:56:05,830
Is this all I get for taking the fall for all of you?

858
00:56:05,900 --> 00:56:06,900
CEO Seo!

859
00:56:07,440 --> 00:56:08,840
When he held the press conference,

860
00:56:09,300 --> 00:56:12,140
he didn't have to reveal the entire truth.

861
00:56:12,240 --> 00:56:16,110
He should've spun it better with a few white lies.

862
00:56:17,180 --> 00:56:21,020
Now the public is in an uproar. This is just embarrassing.

863
00:56:21,080 --> 00:56:22,080
So...

864
00:56:23,080 --> 00:56:27,220
if we cover this up with lies, how will you handle the backlash?

865
00:56:27,260 --> 00:56:29,220
That's their problem to deal with.

866
00:56:29,460 --> 00:56:32,760
Why should we have to take on this kind of risk?

867
00:56:33,560 --> 00:56:36,730
In the first place, the director, an investor, and an actor...

868
00:56:36,970 --> 00:56:39,029
being from the same family already doesn't look good.

869
00:56:39,030 --> 00:56:41,840
And now they're being framed as a dysfunctional family.

870
00:56:42,540 --> 00:56:45,410
- Is that acceptable for this movie? - What if I step down?

871
00:56:48,040 --> 00:56:49,110
Darn it.

872
00:56:51,710 --> 00:56:53,450
Why are you here? Let's talk outside.

873
00:56:58,720 --> 00:56:59,790
If I step down,

874
00:57:02,720 --> 00:57:03,830
will Director Joo Yi Jae...

875
00:57:06,260 --> 00:57:07,900
be able to proceed with the movie?

876
00:57:31,850 --> 00:57:32,890
Woo Su Bin, are you okay?

877
00:57:33,660 --> 00:57:36,490
Hey, those reporters were awful. Why are they hounding you like this?

878
00:57:36,560 --> 00:57:37,790
It's not like you did anything wrong.

879
00:57:50,710 --> 00:57:53,370
Nothing's wrong, right?

880
00:57:55,840 --> 00:57:57,579
We can still make the movie, right?

881
00:57:57,580 --> 00:57:58,710
I love you.

882
00:58:00,550 --> 00:58:01,620
Yi Jae.

883
00:58:04,620 --> 00:58:05,690
Me too.

884
00:58:06,550 --> 00:58:07,760
I love you too.

885
00:58:10,990 --> 00:58:12,130
That's all I need.

886
00:59:15,860 --> 00:59:17,890
(Dream To You)

887
00:59:17,990 --> 00:59:20,760
We have to make the best choice right now.

888
00:59:20,830 --> 00:59:23,800
And that best choice is to erase Director Woo from the picture?

889
00:59:24,000 --> 00:59:25,200
CEO Ahn, just a moment.

890
00:59:25,530 --> 00:59:27,940
We can't shoot this film without Director Woo.

891
00:59:27,970 --> 00:59:29,500
Your father has cancer.

892
00:59:29,570 --> 00:59:31,409
For ten years, it was only an hour.

893
00:59:31,410 --> 00:59:33,609
- Now I'm on for the full two hours. - Is that right?

894
00:59:33,610 --> 00:59:36,210
Is it always this scary after the final shoot?

895
00:59:36,440 --> 00:59:37,709
I don't want to settle for this.

896
00:59:37,710 --> 00:59:39,679
I want to learn more. Should I study abroad?

897
00:59:39,680 --> 00:59:41,380
My dream is you, Joo Yi Jae.

898
00:59:42,050 --> 00:59:43,380
Don't go, Yi Jae.